nfirmation:\n\n```powershell\nRemove-PnPListItem -List \"Projects\" -Identity 5 -Force\n```\n\n## Content Types\n\nContent types define reusable sets of columns and behaviors. View available content types with:\n\n```powershell\nGet-PnPContentType\n```\n\nTo see content types specific to a list:\n\n```powershell\nGet-PnPContentType -List \"Projects\"\n```\n\n## Adding Content Types to Lists\n\nApply an existing site content type to a list:\n\n```powershell\nAdd-PnPContentTypeToList -List \"Projects\" `\n    -ContentType \"Document\" -DefaultContentType\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** The `-DefaultContentType` switch makes the added content type the default for new items. Without it, the content type is available but not pre-selected when users create items.\n0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"SharePoint & M365 PowerShell\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/site-permissions\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Managing Site Permissions\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M15.75 19.5L8.25 12l7.5-7.5\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500\",\"children\":[4,\" / \",8]}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/teams-and-groups\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Managing Teams and Groups\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"}]}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"List Items and Content Types\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"lesson\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"List Items and Content Types\",\"description\":\"Working with list data and content types.\",\"slug\":\"list-items-and-content-types\",\"order\":4,\"prerequisites\":[\"m3-l3\"]},\"content\":\"$4\",\"exercises\":[{\"id\":\"m3-l4-ex1\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write a CAML query command to get items from the 'Tickets' list where the Priority field equals 'High'. Store the CAML XML in a $query variable, then pass it to Get-PnPListItem.\",\"hints\":[\"Define $query with a CAML <View> containing a <Where> clause.\",\"Use <Eq> with <FieldRef Name='Priority'/> and <Value Type='Text'>High</Value>.\",\"Pass the query variable with Get-PnPListItem -List \\\"Tickets\\\" -Query $query.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-PnPListItem\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use Get-PnPListItem to retrieve list items.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-List\\\\s+[\\\"']?Tickets[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -List \\\"Tickets\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-Query\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the -Query parameter to pass your CAML query.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"FieldRef\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Your CAML query needs a <FieldRef> element to reference the Priority field.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"High\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Filter for the value 'High'.\"}],\"solution\":\"$$query = \\\"<View><Query><Where><Eq><FieldRef Name='Priority'/><Value Type='Text'>High</Value></Eq></Where></Query></View>\\\"\\nGet-PnPListItem -List \\\"Tickets\\\" -Query $query\",\"explanation\":\"CAML queries filter data on the server side, which is more efficient than downloading all items and filtering locally. The <Eq> operator checks for exact matches.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l4-ex2\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to add a new item to the 'Contacts' list with Title set to 'John Smith' and Email set to 'john@example.com'.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Add-PnPListItem with the -List and -Values parameters.\",\"The -Values parameter takes a hashtable: @{ Key = \\\"Value\\\" }.\",\"Include both Title and Email in the hashtable.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Add-PnPListItem\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Add-PnPListItem cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-List\\\\s+[\\\"']?Contacts[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -List \\\"Contacts\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-Values\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -Values to provide field values as a hashtable.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"John Smith\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set the Title to 'John Smith'.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"john@example.com\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set the Email to 'john@example.com'.\"}],\"solution\":\"Add-PnPListItem -List \\\"Contacts\\\" -Values @{ Title = \\\"John Smith\\\"; Email = \\\"john@example.com\\\" }\",\"explanation\":\"Add-PnPListItem creates a new list item. The -Values hashtable maps field internal names to values. Use semicolons to separate entries on one line.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l4-ex3\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to update list item with ID 12 in the 'Contacts' list, changing the Email field to 'updated@example.com'.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Set-PnPListItem to update existing items.\",\"The -Identity parameter takes the item ID.\",\"Pass the new values with -Values as a hashtable.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Set-PnPListItem\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Set-PnPListItem cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-List\\\\s+[\\\"']?Contacts[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -List \\\"Contacts\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-Identity\\\\s+12\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -Identity 12 to target item 12.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"updated@example.com\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set the Email field to 'updated@example.com'.\"}],\"solution\":\"Set-PnPListItem -List \\\"Contacts\\\" -Identity 12 -Values @{ Email = \\\"updated@example.com\\\" }\",\"explanation\":\"Set-PnPListItem modifies an existing item. Only the fields you include in -Values are updated; other fields remain unchanged.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l4-ex4\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to add the 'Task' content type to the 'Projects' list and make it the default content type.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Add-PnPContentTypeToList.\",\"Specify the list with -List and the content type with -ContentType.\",\"Use the -DefaultContentType switch to make it the default.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Add-PnPContentTypeToList\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Add-PnPContentTypeToList cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-List\\\\s+[\\\"']?Projects[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -List \\\"Projects\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-ContentType\\\\s+[\\\"']?Task[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -ContentType \\\"Task\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-DefaultContentType\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Add the -DefaultContentType switch to set it as the default.\"}],\"solution\":\"Add-PnPContentTypeToList -List \\\"Projects\\\" -ContentType \\\"Task\\\" -DefaultContentType\",\"explanation\":\"Add-PnPContentTypeToList associates a site content type with a list. The -DefaultContentType switch ensures new items use this content type by default.\"}],\"moduleSlug\":\"sharepoint-m365\"}}],\"$L5\"]}],[\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"CCxR80sZRnjlIdOoXSFK7\"}\n5:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-zinc-800/60\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/site-permissions\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"Managing Site Permissions\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/teams-and-groups\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-200\",\"children\":[\"Managing Teams and Groups\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\"}]}]]}]]}]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0